WEBVTT

00:02:07.841 --> 00:02:10.510
Slow poke. Come on. Eat up, will ya?

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:13.280
Well, I'm not like you, Ryoko.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:16.116
I really can't bring
myself to eat like a barbarian.

00:02:16.116 --> 00:02:17.451
First I start with my appetizers...

00:02:17.451 --> 00:02:18.885
and then move on to my soup.

00:02:18.885 --> 00:02:22.155
Hey, it's just pickles and miso soup.

00:02:22.155 --> 00:02:24.624
Excuse me. Oh, Mr. Manager?

00:02:24.624 --> 00:02:26.193
I think it's about time
you served us our main dish.

00:02:26.193 --> 00:02:30.664
You know our order: The extra-large beef bowls.

00:02:30.664 --> 00:02:33.700
Sorry. I've got part-time help today.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.802
Your order should be
coming right up, Ma'am.

00:02:35.802 --> 00:02:39.739
Hey, Amarube, Yura
that's a long-enough break!

00:02:39.739 --> 00:02:42.342
Come on, you two, get back to work!

00:02:42.342 --> 00:02:45.612
Amarube, Yura, you are fired!

00:02:45.612 --> 00:02:47.581
Now get out!

00:02:47.581 --> 00:02:50.183
Ha! Scream your head off.

00:02:50.183 --> 00:02:53.653
We were leaving anyway, you big mouth.

00:02:53.653 --> 00:02:57.891
I'm too good to be working
in a beef bowl joint anyway.

00:02:57.891 --> 00:03:00.060
Space is calling to me.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:04.190
It's telling me I can be
something... become something great.

00:03:15.809 --> 00:03:17.970
Hey, Amarube, it's open.

00:03:19.145 --> 00:03:20.635
Okay.

00:03:21.448 --> 00:03:22.382
This is it.

00:03:22.382 --> 00:03:27.752
The legend of Amarube and Yura, the
delinquent duo of space, begins today.

00:03:34.594 --> 00:03:37.264
Thank you very much.

00:03:37.264 --> 00:03:41.268
Hey, Ayeka, we're going to
head back to Yagami now, okay?

00:03:41.268 --> 00:03:42.860
All right.

00:03:55.615 --> 00:03:57.606
What the heck?

00:04:12.899 --> 00:04:14.167
Yagami.

00:04:14.167 --> 00:04:15.602
That's Yagami!

00:04:15.602 --> 00:04:17.866
Hey, stop!

00:04:20.473 --> 00:04:23.610
Where are you going?
Don't go anywhere without us!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.341
Please wait for me! I want to get on!

00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:49.769
Oh, well. It's gone.

00:04:49.769 --> 00:04:51.538
Yagami's been hijacked.

00:04:51.538 --> 00:04:53.440
How can you be so casual about it?

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:56.000
What? Really?

00:05:01.781 --> 00:05:04.618
Yagami's leaving! Yagami's leaving!

00:05:04.618 --> 00:05:07.416
Why? Why? Why?

00:05:12.926 --> 00:05:18.732
Whoever stole my ship
sure had a lot of nerve.

00:05:18.732 --> 00:05:21.368
That's all I can say.

00:05:21.368 --> 00:05:23.470
Yagami's <i>my</i> ship.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.506
C-Come on, girls, let's focus.

00:05:26.506 --> 00:05:29.209
First I'm gonna find them and
then I'm gonna beat 'em up real good.

00:05:29.209 --> 00:05:31.302
Come on, Ryo-Ohki.

00:05:42.322 --> 00:05:43.757
Let's go!

00:05:43.757 --> 00:05:45.520
Okay. Right.

00:05:51.698 --> 00:05:53.099
Ryo-Ohki is leaving us.

00:05:53.099 --> 00:05:56.236
Hey, Tenchi, wait for us!

00:05:56.236 --> 00:05:59.839
Please call a space cab,
Sasami. We should follow them.

00:05:59.839 --> 00:06:02.740
But I don't have any money.

00:06:16.389 --> 00:06:18.152
Here's your check.

00:06:31.371 --> 00:06:33.940
We are cruising!

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:37.000
All right! Go faster!

00:06:44.184 --> 00:06:46.586
We must not let them get away, Ryoko.

00:06:46.586 --> 00:06:48.021
Count on me.

00:06:48.021 --> 00:06:51.855
I do. Grandpa and Dad
are still on Yagami, you know.

00:06:56.362 --> 00:07:00.033
Gee, where are they?

00:07:00.033 --> 00:07:02.866
I wonder, do you think they
forgot about our beef bowls?

00:07:04.437 --> 00:07:07.941
Easy now. Don't act so desperate.

00:07:07.941 --> 00:07:11.111
A samurai should betray
absolutely no weakness when starving.

00:07:11.111 --> 00:07:13.170
But, Dad, come on.

00:07:14.547 --> 00:07:16.242
Checkmate.

00:08:16.576 --> 00:08:19.145
Hey, idiot, you ran a red light.

00:08:19.145 --> 00:08:21.978
Why don't you look
where you're going, you jerk?

00:08:35.228 --> 00:08:37.163
Great. Now we've lost them.

00:08:37.163 --> 00:08:40.934
Now what? What's gonna
happen to Dad and Grandpa?

00:08:40.934 --> 00:08:43.136
What about Yagami? What about my ship?

00:08:43.136 --> 00:08:45.171
I can't do anything about it now!

00:08:45.171 --> 00:08:46.806
Hey, I know.

00:08:46.806 --> 00:08:49.542
Why don't we report this
incident to the galaxy police?

00:08:49.542 --> 00:08:51.144
What do you think, huh?

00:08:51.144 --> 00:08:53.646
Mihoshi, and just who
do you think we are, huh?

00:08:53.646 --> 00:08:56.049
Can you tell me? Huh?

00:08:56.049 --> 00:09:01.681
We are the most wanted criminals
in the entire universe. Aren't we?

00:09:05.258 --> 00:09:07.590
To us!

00:09:09.896 --> 00:09:12.799
So we did it, Amarube.

00:09:12.799 --> 00:09:14.267
A piece of cake.

00:09:14.267 --> 00:09:17.759
To the best gangster in the universe.
Stealing this ship was too easy.

00:09:19.472 --> 00:09:25.001
Ya know, it's always been a dream
of mine to travel in a ship like this.

00:09:26.045 --> 00:09:29.883
Well, you've got your wish.
And thus our legend begins.

00:09:29.883 --> 00:09:34.411
But how? What are we gonna do to
become a legend? Tell me the plan.

00:09:36.689 --> 00:09:39.692
Huh, well, first of all...

00:09:39.692 --> 00:09:42.395
...what do you say we sell
this ship and get us some dough?

00:09:42.395 --> 00:09:45.798
Great, I want a nice
purse and some new shoes,

00:09:45.798 --> 00:09:47.800
and a piece of cheesecake from Sirius!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.234
And I'm gonna buy myself a spaceship.

00:09:51.304 --> 00:09:54.967
If that's what you want,
why don't you just keep this one?

00:09:58.578 --> 00:10:00.443
You said it!

00:10:21.801 --> 00:10:23.636
Attention all patrols.

00:10:23.636 --> 00:10:27.440
We have just spotted
Yagami in space zone 602.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.375
Repeat: Attention all patrols.

00:10:29.375 --> 00:10:33.446
We have just spotted
Yagami in space zone 602.

00:10:33.446 --> 00:10:37.542
Proceed to the scene immediately.
Proceed to the scene immediately.

00:10:45.358 --> 00:10:47.093
This is the galaxy police.

00:10:47.093 --> 00:10:50.330
Yagami, stop your engine right now.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.999
We will attack if you don't cooperate.

00:10:52.999 --> 00:10:54.367
I don't get it.

00:10:54.367 --> 00:10:56.536
How did those guys know
this was a hijacked ship?

00:10:56.536 --> 00:10:59.272
What's our plan for this?

00:10:59.272 --> 00:11:01.103
We'll just outrun them.

00:11:04.043 --> 00:11:06.773
They're trying to get away!
Engage in pursuit!

00:11:09.582 --> 00:11:11.751
You see? They're no match for me.

00:11:11.751 --> 00:11:13.219
They must be dreaming,

00:11:13.219 --> 00:11:15.655
if they think they can catch the
greatest gangster in the universe.

00:11:15.655 --> 00:11:18.818
Yagami. That name
sounds familiar somehow.

00:11:21.594 --> 00:11:23.062
Hey, you know what, Amarube?

00:11:23.062 --> 00:11:24.297
What?

00:11:24.297 --> 00:11:25.198
Look!

00:11:25.198 --> 00:11:26.722
Huh?

00:11:35.074 --> 00:11:36.242
Oh, man, what's happening?

00:11:36.242 --> 00:11:41.202
It's just a regular hijacking.
I mean, aren't they kind of overdoing it?

00:12:00.566 --> 00:12:03.503
Earlier today, Princess Ayeka
and her group were spotted

00:12:03.503 --> 00:12:06.939
in space zone 602
aboard the spaceship Yagami.

00:12:06.939 --> 00:12:12.278
The galaxy police are in hot pursuit
and are heading toward space zone 528.

00:12:12.278 --> 00:12:14.213
What?

00:12:14.213 --> 00:12:18.751
On board Yagami are Princess Ayeka,
her sister Princess Sasami

00:12:18.751 --> 00:12:24.157
the space pirate, Ryoko and two former
galaxy police officers, Mihoshi and Kiyone.

00:12:24.157 --> 00:12:26.717
They are all wanted criminals.

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:30.029
Hey, they were customers
at the beef bowl place, Yura.

00:12:30.029 --> 00:12:33.833
Then don't you see?
This ship belongs to them.

00:12:33.833 --> 00:12:37.770
So we're being mistaken, for the
most wanted criminals in the universe!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.338
Oh, no!

00:12:39.338 --> 00:12:40.673
Oh, this is too perfect.

00:12:40.673 --> 00:12:44.277
All right, people, now
we know where Yagami is.

00:12:44.277 --> 00:12:45.878
Just what's there to be cheerful about?

00:12:45.878 --> 00:12:48.247
The galaxy police are after us, you know?

00:12:48.247 --> 00:12:50.883
Yeah, well, let me worry about them, okay?

00:12:50.883 --> 00:12:54.683
Ryo-Ohki, proceed
immediately to space zone 528.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:01.426
Grandpa, Dad, I hope you're safe.

00:13:04.263 --> 00:13:06.599
Chess is a battle fought peacefully.

00:13:06.599 --> 00:13:11.337
It cultivates the mind, the spirit and the soul.

00:13:11.337 --> 00:13:13.669
And we must always cultivate the soul.

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.435
Checkmate.

00:13:31.958 --> 00:13:34.393
Amarube, do something!

00:13:34.393 --> 00:13:36.362
You want to be the greatest
gangster in the universe, right?

00:13:36.362 --> 00:13:39.297
You want to be a legend, right?

00:13:40.266 --> 00:13:42.235
Easy for you to say.

00:13:42.235 --> 00:13:45.329
Doesn't this ship have a
turbo booster or something?

00:13:51.978 --> 00:13:53.479
No!

00:13:53.479 --> 00:13:55.276
What did I do?

00:13:59.785 --> 00:14:01.888
They fired at us, Captain.

00:14:01.888 --> 00:14:02.922
Return fire.

00:14:02.922 --> 00:14:05.914
These are most wanted
criminals. Show no mercy.

00:14:12.031 --> 00:14:14.467
This report just in.

00:14:14.467 --> 00:14:15.902
Apparently, moments ago...

00:14:15.902 --> 00:14:18.771
Yagami and the galaxy
police began exchanging fire.

00:14:18.771 --> 00:14:21.574
Now they're making things
even more complicated.

00:14:21.574 --> 00:14:24.544
No kidding, but we don't
want to get caught, either.

00:14:24.544 --> 00:14:26.279
We should be rooting for them.

00:14:26.279 --> 00:14:28.414
Come on! Get away from the police!

00:14:28.414 --> 00:14:33.078
I have mixed feelings about this.
We're rooting for the hijackers?

00:14:36.022 --> 00:14:39.892
What are you doing, idiot?
You got the police all angry!

00:14:39.892 --> 00:14:42.795
Well, I really didn't mean to.

00:14:42.795 --> 00:14:45.131
You have nowhere to hide, Princess Ayeka.

00:14:45.131 --> 00:14:47.366
It's just a slight misunderstanding!

00:14:47.366 --> 00:14:50.269
Yeah, we're just a
couple of innocent gangsters.

00:14:50.269 --> 00:14:53.172
Oh, I'm so scared!

00:14:53.172 --> 00:14:55.808
Please, help me, Mommy!

00:14:55.808 --> 00:14:56.776
How pathetic.

00:14:56.776 --> 00:14:59.579
And those are the guys
that stole Yagami from us?

00:14:59.579 --> 00:15:03.883
But I feel so sorry for them being
mistaken for the most wanted criminals.

00:15:03.883 --> 00:15:05.251
Will you please...

00:15:05.251 --> 00:15:09.956
Oh, no! We're gonna be killed!
And I don't want to die!

00:15:09.956 --> 00:15:12.358
When are we going to
catch up with them, Ryoko?

00:15:12.358 --> 00:15:14.460
It's not that easy, Tenchi.

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:16.894
They are traveling at
top speed too, you know?

00:15:19.298 --> 00:15:21.601
Checkmate.

00:15:21.601 --> 00:15:23.369
Now just wait.

00:15:23.369 --> 00:15:26.172
Well, now, there's no waiting in battle.

00:15:26.172 --> 00:15:28.774
But I'll do this instead.

00:15:28.774 --> 00:15:30.943
What?

00:15:30.943 --> 00:15:34.013
Looks like we don't have any other choice.

00:15:34.013 --> 00:15:36.682
We don't?

00:15:36.682 --> 00:15:39.785
Operation Speedup, Ryo-Ohki.

00:15:39.785 --> 00:15:42.982
If we use this tactic on Ryo-Ohki...

00:15:59.572 --> 00:16:03.409
But that is a chili pepper
from the beef bowl place.

00:16:03.409 --> 00:16:06.479
Feeding some chili pepper to Ryo-Ohki?

00:16:06.479 --> 00:16:08.147
That's what you meant by Operation Speedup?

00:16:08.147 --> 00:16:09.415
Well, yeah.

00:16:09.415 --> 00:16:11.150
Unfortunately, by using this tactic

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:14.085
Ryo-Ohki will be angry
with me for a couple of days.

00:16:44.283 --> 00:16:45.944
There it is.

00:16:52.692 --> 00:16:54.626
That star is...

00:17:01.801 --> 00:17:05.404
Yagami is heading straight
toward that supernova.

00:17:05.404 --> 00:17:08.066
Good. Then they can't go anywhere else.

00:17:09.241 --> 00:17:11.243
I can't take this anymore!

00:17:11.243 --> 00:17:13.079
Stop! Please, let's just go home!

00:17:13.079 --> 00:17:15.240
Amarube!

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:31.430
We'll be entering the supernova's
gravitational field in two minutes.

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:34.695
Once we go in the sphere of
gravitation, we won't be able to escape.

00:17:41.841 --> 00:17:43.909
Hurry up, Ryoko.

00:17:43.909 --> 00:17:45.774
You've got to trust me.

00:18:04.096 --> 00:18:08.534
Sixty-four seconds before
we reach the gravisphere.

00:18:08.534 --> 00:18:10.798
All right, hold the fleet.

00:18:30.623 --> 00:18:32.124
They're totally out of it.

00:18:32.124 --> 00:18:34.226
What's this?

00:18:34.226 --> 00:18:36.529
Grandpa! Dad!

00:18:36.529 --> 00:18:38.664
Welcome back, Tenchi.

00:18:38.664 --> 00:18:40.996
What took you so long there, my son?

00:18:46.639 --> 00:18:48.073
What should we do now?

00:18:48.073 --> 00:18:49.375
Don't worry.

00:18:49.375 --> 00:18:52.611
According to my calculations,
we can use the gravity to escape

00:18:52.611 --> 00:18:57.216
if we go in it at a 34º angle and
then go full blast 8.1 seconds later.

00:18:57.216 --> 00:19:00.152
Use the gravity? Are you insane?

00:19:00.152 --> 00:19:02.382
Well, we don't have time to argue.

00:19:04.056 --> 00:19:06.650
Accelerating? They're crazy!

00:19:17.436 --> 00:19:19.028
Go now!

00:19:26.245 --> 00:19:28.736
No. It's not possible.

00:19:33.185 --> 00:19:35.788
Yes! We've done it!

00:19:35.788 --> 00:19:38.382
So am I a genius, or what?

00:19:39.158 --> 00:19:44.494
And so the hijacking of
Yagami incident finally ended.

00:19:51.937 --> 00:19:53.973
Whew. I'm exhausted.

00:19:53.973 --> 00:19:56.464
Oh, boy. What an ordeal that was.

00:19:58.444 --> 00:20:01.113
This beef bowl is really good, isn't it, Dad?

00:20:01.113 --> 00:20:04.850
Yes. The onions, especially. Very tasty.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:06.685
Good beef bowls, huh?

00:20:06.685 --> 00:20:09.779
Beef bowls? Beef bowls?

00:20:11.524 --> 00:20:15.594
What about beef bowls, Tenchi?

00:20:15.594 --> 00:20:18.893
We're forgetting about Ayeka and Sasami!

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.352
That's three hours dish washing.

00:20:40.352 --> 00:20:43.289
That means you have another 89 hours to go.

00:20:43.289 --> 00:20:45.883
O-Oh, no!

00:20:48.694 --> 00:20:50.355
Here you go.

00:20:53.699 --> 00:21:00.605
Please come and rescue us, Tenchi!

00:22:57.089 --> 00:22:58.290
Did you hear that?

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:00.426
There'll be a swimsuit
contest in our next episode.

00:23:00.426 --> 00:23:03.062
Yes, Ryoko. It seems to be a
great opportunity for us to prove

00:23:03.062 --> 00:23:06.432
which one of us is superior, don't you think?

00:23:06.432 --> 00:23:09.301
It sure does. The contest will
decide who the real winner is.

00:23:09.301 --> 00:23:15.171
Now I can show off
this perfect body of mine.

00:23:18.377 --> 00:23:20.045
Coming up next is "No Need for Swimsuits!"

00:23:20.045 --> 00:23:21.747
Well, they can do whatever they want.

00:23:21.747 --> 00:23:24.511
It's unquestionably beautiful.
